We can compute that the side length of the hexagon is $\frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}.$  Then one side of the hexagon is parameterized by
\[\frac{1}{2} + ti,\]where $-\frac{1}{2 \sqrt{3}} \le t \le \frac{1}{2 \sqrt{3}}.$

[asy]
unitsize (4 cm);

pair A, B, C, D, E, F;

